  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_01",
      "hash64": "E4F2D8E37D111C96",
      "text": "哎呀，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_02",
      "hash64": "E4F2D7E37D111AE3",
      "text": "听说你要和妮莫一起去上学？[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_01",
      "hash64": "C21E4249095E5426",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的事\\n就包在我身上了！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_03",
      "hash64": "E4F2D6E37D111930",
      "text": "你这么快就交到朋友了啊。[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_04",
      "hash64": "E4F2DDE37D112515",
      "text": "我看了学校的小册子，\\n老师们个个都很棒！\\r\\n还能随意使用很实用的设施呢！[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_05",
      "hash64": "E4F2DCE37D112362",
      "text": "而且还有妮莫在，\\n你的学院生活应该会很有趣！[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_09",
      "hash64": "E4F2E0E37D112A2E",
      "text": "从今天开始你就要住在学校宿舍了，\\n要好好吃饭哦。[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_06",
      "hash64": "E4F2DBE37D1121AF",
      "text": "这是零花钱和便当！\\n要珍惜一点用。[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_10",
      "hash64": "E4EF53E37D0E04C0",
      "text": "对了，还有！\\n这些你也拿去。[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_11",
      "hash64": "E4EF54E37D0E0673",
      "text": "要是你的好搭档受伤了，\\n就给它用这个。[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_12",
      "hash64": "E4EF55E37D0E0826",
      "text": "从现在开始，你要离开自己的家，\\n开始充满新鲜体验的每一天了。[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_13",
      "hash64": "E4EF56E37D0E09D9",
      "text": "不管遇到快乐的事还是麻烦的事，\\n都多多地体验一下吧！[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_07",
      "hash64": "E4F2DAE37D111FFC",
      "text": "不过，\\n你随时都可以回家休息哦。[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_08",
      "hash64": "E4F2E1E37D112BE1",
      "text": "那好，你们俩该走了，\\n路上要小心啊！[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_02",
      "hash64": "C21E4149095E5273",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你的妈妈真体贴，\\n好棒啊！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_03",
      "hash64": "C21E4049095E50C0",
      "text": "对了，我说过要教你\\n怎么捉宝可梦的！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_04",
      "hash64": "C21E4749095E5CA5",
      "text": "这边这边！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
